        "t": 258.7537500000001,
        "r": 530.0611000000005,
        "b": 191.99625000000003
      },
      "content": "Disconnect the AC inlet wire and the SMPS to Rear board DC wire, the Battery wire and the External DC input wire from the SMPS."
